# Kamailio dispatcher.list — FreeSWITCH SIP node pool
# Format: SET_ID  SIP_URI  FLAGS
# Set 1: primary FreeSWITCH nodes
# Flags: 0 = active
#
# Add one line per FreeSWITCH instance.
# Kamailio health-checks via SIP OPTIONS every 10s (see kamailio.cfg).
# Failed nodes (OPTIONS timeout) are automatically removed from active pool.
#
1 sip:freeswitch-1:5060 0
1 sip:freeswitch-2:5060 0
